# Description: Magento 2.4.6 + PHP 8.2 + MariaDB 10.11 + OpenSearch 2.19 + Redis 7.0 + Varnish 8
#
# Stack-only preset for `make configure PRESET=magento-legacy`. PROJECT_NAME,
# SITE_HOST and USE_NODE are filled in by the wizard (or by env vars on the
# command line). All values below are validated against the compatibility
# matrix in dockerimages/bin/init.sh - update them in lockstep when the
# matrix moves. 2.4.6 left regular support in Aug 2026 (extended support to Aug
# 2027); this preset keeps the pre-Valkey Redis path alive for projects
# pinned to an older 2.4.6 patch level (below -p11, when Valkey arrived).
# Past -p11, flip CACHE_ENGINE=valkey in .env after configuring.
FLAVOUR=magento
MAGENTO_VERSION=2.4.6
PHP_VERSION=8.2
DB_ENGINE=mariadb
DB_VERSION=10.11
OPENSEARCH_VERSION=2.19.6
CACHE_ENGINE=redis
USE_VARNISH=yes
